+
+2. **Derive target time complexity**: Based on the constraints and typical time limits (usually 1-2 seconds), calculate what time complexity is acceptable:
+   - For n ≤ 10^3: O(n^2) or O(n^2 log n) is acceptable
+   - For n ≤ 10^4: O(n^2) might be tight, O(n log n) is better
