+   - Compare output from your solution against the brute-force reference
+   - Run several iterations to ensure correctness
+   - The test should import/use both your solution and the brute-force reference
+
+7. **Create performance test** at `/tmp/perf_test.py`:
+   - Generate worst-case inputs at maximum constraint sizes with various patterns:
