+## Design Decisions
+
+### 1. Bounded Loop Instead of While True
+```python
+for iteration in range(1, 6):  # Exactly 5 iterations
+    ...
+    if iteration >= 5:
+        break  # Explicit termination
+```
+✓ Prevents infinite loops
+✓ Clear termination condition
+✓ Agent can still make meaningful decisions each iteration
+
+### 2. get_current_edits() in Loop
+Each iteration provides agent with current diff vs base commit:
+```python
+current_edits = self.get_current_edits()
+review_instruction = f"...\n{str(current_edits[0]['content'][0]['text'])}"
+```
+✓ Agent sees what changed
+✓ Enables informed redesign decisions
+✓ Tracks progress across iterations
+
+### 3. Three-Tier Testing Strategy
+- **Stress tests (small inputs)**: Catch logic bugs quickly
+- **Performance tests (large inputs)**: Catch complexity issues
+- **Complexity verification**: Catch false claims
+
+All three required for robust solution validation.
